geou=[
([0,3],None,'vegetation cover','percent',[58,60,62],[28,30,32],'Equal-sized districts are compared before land clearing (A) and afterwards (B).','Clearing directly removes vegetation and can fragment remaining habitat, altering land cover.','The sample does not identify which land use replaced the vegetation or the whole region’s pattern.','Map land-cover classes at equal resolution across a larger representative area and validate them with ground observations.'),
([1,3],None,'surface temperature','°C',[24,25,26],[30,31,32],'Equal-time daytime measurements compare vegetated sites (A) with paved sites (B).','Vegetation provides shade and evapotranspiration, whereas paved surfaces may absorb and store more heat.','Site building density, surface colour and weather may also differ.','Match exposure and measurement times, use calibrated sensors and sample multiple sites with comparable urban form.'),
([0,4],None,'soil loss','tonnes ha⁻¹ yr⁻¹',[18,20,22],[8,10,12],'Sloping plots use bare cultivation (A) or contour strips and vegetation (B).','Vegetated strips and contour management can slow runoff and trap sediment, reducing erosion.','Rainfall intensity and slope differences may affect erosion independently.','Compare matched slopes over several rainfall events with equal measuring methods; this improves a management comparison.'),
([1,3],None,'runoff volume','m³',[18,20,22],[38,40,42],'Similar catchments have lower impervious cover (A) or higher impervious cover (B) during equal modelled rainfall.','Impervious surfaces reduce infiltration and can increase rapid surface runoff.','Real catchments also differ in soils, drainage and antecedent moisture.','Map impervious cover and drainage and measure rainfall and antecedent moisture in matched catchments.'),
([0,2],None,'forest patch area','ha',[80,100,120],[30,40,50],'Mapped forest patches are measured before road expansion (A) and after it (B).','Infrastructure can subdivide continuous cover into smaller patches, increasing fragmentation.','Patch area alone does not quantify connectivity, habitat quality or total forest area.','Measure patch count, connectivity and total cover with consistent imagery and ground checks.')]
for i,row in enumerate(geou):data_set('geography',f'landcover-{i}',*row)
